      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You have my full vote on this one. I need this so bad holy hecc. i dont like to emit it but 99% of people on my friends list are strangers to me. The memory is still there, its just not linked with the person that i forgot. I end up having to ask if they can remind me of a memory, like an event or introduction, we shared. Only then i remember everything we did. It makes me feel guilty every time as i don't want to forget them. A simple note would help so soo much with this. I can finally stop being on orange so much with this >.<",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
