      "mergeID": "62f4df1e0635655d416e1fbc",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I have a disability which makes it very hard for me to remember names and faces -which is even harder on VRC when people can change their appearance so easily.\nI make use of a mod called EMMvrc which allows me to make personal notes about people I meet to help me remember who they are and where I met them. This is so helpful for me and without it, I wouldn't be able to use the game comfortably.\nIf this feature could be added to the base game, I would appreciate it, even though with mods being removed by this EAC thing, I will lose all the notes I have at the moment.\nKind regards,\nKyuu",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Ability to make notes about users you meet in game",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "59072e81ce24cf7c0cd597dd",
      "private": false,
