      "mergeID": "62f5eebb6db08d44a8db3713",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Problem:\nWe have many conversations with different people all the time, and sometimes we friend them and don't remember where we met them. Because of that the development of a friendship or social interaction is severed.\nSolution:\nEditable bio per friend a player can do in his friends list, so you remember where you met the player and any relevant information you need to keep the conversation going.",
