      "mergeID": "6315c5e0cec089449ccce2ad",
      "mergedPostDetails": "If you play VRChat, you are more likely to make many friends in the in-game. It doesn't matter if the number of friends is small, but if the number of friends is large, it is often seen that each friend can't remember who it is. So I suggest adding a simple memo function. For example, I think it's a convenient feature to add a memo function to your friend's profile to write \"where you met and who you are.\"",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Add notes from your social friends list",
